# The extension launches the Python engine from its own install folder (bridge_server.py), so the package must
# contain exactly the engine files the bridge imports plus the compiled extension. Everything else is excluded:
# this is an ALLOWLIST. Verified in CI by tools/check_release.py (--vsix) and by running the packaged bridge.
**

!package.json
!README.md
!LICENSE
!out/extension.js

# Python engine: root launcher + the package modules the bridge imports (bridge -> pipeline -> data_contracts, registry; protocol)
!bridge_server.py
!contextgate/__init__.py
!contextgate/bridge.py
!contextgate/pipeline.py
!contextgate/data_contracts.py
!contextgate/registry.py
!contextgate/protocol.py
